      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST QUICKLY (6) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 4 length third over 390m this track in 22.69. Can find winning form. IVORY HAMADA (3) was fast away from wide out with an impressive early sectional and went on to clock 22.42 in a 1.5 lengths win at this track over 390m. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. One of the key runners again. HEAVY HAULAGE (2) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (22.89) at Warragul the start prior. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Form from his last run is proving strong. Has ability and can measure up. ACCOUNTS MANAGER (4) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
